SUMMARY:FUN RIDE - DH Donegal Loop Ride (17R) RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Volunteer to
  lead!\nRide Sweep: Volunteer to Sweep\nAnticipated Average Pace: \\~11 mp
 h\nRoute: [DH Donegal Loop Ride (17R)](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/cue/dh-donegal-loop-ride-17r/)\n\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Togeth
 er**\n\nWithout a volunteer leader\, this event is Show and Go.\nThe depar
 ture location is the same as the Tour de Red Rose\, just an hour later\, s
 o there will be other cyclists to help but on a different route.\nIf you w
 ant to volunteer to lead\, leave a comment for this ride\, or contact Rick
  Zook.\n\nThis is a FUN RIDE ride. The ride leader will ride at the advert
 ised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rul
 e as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group
  together with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple group
 s to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you ar
 e not willing to ride with the group.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds
 . Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pu
 mp/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, 
 we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Be
 ing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signu
 p](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=25714
 8)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [C
 ode of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&
 club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incid
 ent Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id
 =257148&module_id=326137)
